                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I visited VA headquarters this afternoon to sit down with President Trump\u2019s Veterans secretary, Doug Collins. I\u2019m excited to collaborate with Doug on restoring accountability at the VA, improving veterans\u2019 healthcare, fixing the electronic health record system, and preserving our veterans\u2019 Second Amendment rights. Doug\u2019s a close friend who has visited Southern Illinois on multiple occasions \u2013 his stepping in a new role only bodes well for IL-12 veterans!",
