                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Happy to welcome\u00a0Matt Rush of Fairfield, Garrett Hawkins of Waterloo, Don Guinnip of Marshall, Pervis Ellis of Harrisburg, and other members of\u00a0the Illinois Corn Growers Association to\u00a0my office to discuss the Farm Bill, ethanol,\u00a0corn exports, and crop insurance programs.\u00a0President Trump is working to level the playing field\u00a0for American producers, and I\u2019m working to ensure Southern Illinois\u2019 farmers are heard in the process.",
