                "text": "I met with J.R. Ryberg, John Chrystal, and Stephen Frerichs from the American Association of Crop Insurers to hear their priorities as Farm Bill discussions continue. We talked about the need to protect and strengthen crop insurance, support working families, and ensure key ag programs are reauthorized in the next bill. With conversations picking back up after the shutdown, I appreciated their insight as we work toward a Farm Bill that delivers for Southern Illinois farmers.",
