                "text": "Too many children are being pressured into gender transition procedures far too early, and parents are being shut out of the decision-making process. That\u2019s why I voted this week for the Do No Harm in Medicaid Act, which stops federal Medicaid funds from paying for these procedures on minors, and the Protect Children\u2019s Innocence Act, which makes it a felony for anyone who knowingly performs them.",
